    <name>
      <text>Derivatives of the six trig inverse functions</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="moodle_auto_format">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Find the derivative of the following function:</p>
<p>\(\quad \displaystyle f(x)={@fx@}\)</p>
<p>\(\quad \displaystyle f'(x)=\) [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="moodle_auto_format">
      <text><![CDATA[<h3>Worked Solution</h3>
<p>The derivative of the function \(  \displaystyle f(x)={@fx@}\) with respect to \(x\) is:</p>
<p>\( \qquad  \displaystyle f'(x)={@diff_fx@}\)</p>]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
    <defaultgrade>1</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.1</penalty>
    <hidden>0</hidden>
